OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses to campaign about
OL,4,Aderelict buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses along a road in Grimsby are
OL,7,Fdemanding action to improve two
OL,8,Fderelict buildings on a key route in
OL,9,Fthe town.
OL,11,FTraders along Cleethorpe Road are
OL,12,Fplanning to place banners and draw up a
OL,13,Fpetition protesting about the state of
OL,14,Fthe former Albion pub and an empty
OL,15,Fcommercial property opposite it.
OL,17,FGrant Berry, from the Cleethorpe Road
OL,18,FTraders Association, said: "It's a
OL,19,Fvital gateway road into the area and it
OL,20,Fdoes affect the economy and image of
OL,21,FCleethorpe Road."
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
